From 2a7b1a802e768a6e81ab2e2fb43c37fbb9549626 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 17:53:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(ui): drop a model file on the window to import it

A single dropped stl/obj/step/stp queues the Model dialog's own
ImportFile command; a hint shows while a file hovers. Several files,
a wrong extension or a non-file path are refused by name and leave the
project unchanged.

Fixes #1450

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
